,"turn_index":8}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","text":"Calvin: Hey Dave! Long time no see. I just went to an awesome music thingy in Tokyo - so cool!\n[S3T1] (dia_id: D3:1)\n\nDave: Hey Calvin! Great to hear from you. How was the music thingy in Tokyo? See any cool bands?\n[S3T2] (dia_id: D3:2)\n\nCalvin: Hey Dave! The festival in Tokyo was awesome! Didn't see any bands, but met lots of talented artists and industry people. Totally enriching!\n[S3T3] (dia_id: D3:3)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin, sounds great! What did you learn from it?\n[S3T4] (dia_id: D3:4)\n\nCalvin: I learned a lot and got some great advice from professionals in the music industry. It was inspiring!\n[S3T5] (dia_id: D3:5)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! Bet that was inspiring being surrounded by professionals. Did you get any advice from them?\n[S3T6] (dia_id: D3:6)\n\nCalvin: The producer gave me some advice to stay true to myself and sound unique. It got me thinking about where I want my music to go. It's really motivating!\n[S3T7] (dia_id: D3:7)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! It's really motivating to see you staying true to yourself. It got me thinking, where do you see your music taking you?\n[S3T8] (dia_id: D3:8)","text_sha256":"0fa64c8a4bb126232fa6b0dc9630ef39dd08884d15580de5e800496e3e146643","timestamp":"2023-04-20T16:15:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8305a3e15c2c6f1474569dc78a6580fbb1490e746","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D7:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":13,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S7T1]"],"text_sha256":"012ef9f23f3b50cf765546b114b2598fa9313302d6957a0530e0d6200c696707"},{"dia_ids":["D7:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":17,"line_start":15,"source_locators":["[S7T2]"],"text_sha256":"f4d9526e0fe3720c91774051474d662a5e70fc3c640cac71c149a10664204d75"},{"dia_ids":["D7:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":20,"line_start":19,"source_locators":["[S7T3]"],"text_sha256":"e21ffc108c8713e25b3b276